  <body>
    <front><contents /></front>
    <chapter>
      <heading>
        Software documentation for the TTIOWriter protocol
      </heading>
      <protocol name="TTIOWriter">
        <declared>TTIOWriter.h</declared>
        <conform>NSObject</conform>
        <desc>
          <p>
            <em>Declared In:</em> Export/TTIOWriter.h
          </p>
          <p>
            Uniform exporter interface: serialize one layer of
            an opened dataset to an output path. Per-format adapters
            (OT5/OT6) implement this protocol and the
            exporter registry (OT7) dispatches through it.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Cross-language equivalents:</strong>
            <br /> Python: <code>ttio.exporters.Writer</code>
            <br /> Java:
            <code>global.thalion.ttio.exporters.Writer</code>
          </p>
        </desc>
        <method type="BOOL">
          <sel>writeDataset:</sel>
          <arg type="TTIOSpectralDataset*">dataset</arg>
          <sel>layer:</sel>
          <arg type="NSString*">layer</arg>
          <sel>toOutput:</sel>
          <arg type="NSString*">output</arg>
          <sel>options:</sel>
          <arg type="NSDictionary&lt;NSString*,id&gt;*">options</arg>
          <sel>error:</sel>
          <arg type="NSError*_Nullable*_Nullable">error</arg>
          <desc>
            Serializes one <code><var>layer</var></code> of
            <code><var>dataset</var></code> to
            <code><var>output</var></code>. @param
            <var>dataset</var> The opened <var>dataset</var> to
            export. @param <var>layer</var> Optional layer/run
            selector; <code>nil</code> for the default.
            @param <var>output</var> Destination path. @param
            <var>options</var> Format-specific knobs. @param
            <var>error</var> Out <var>error</var> on failure.
            @return <code>YES</code> on success.
          </desc>
        </method>
      </protocol>
    </chapter>
  </body>
</gsdoc>
